 account, no setup. \n • Real microphone device — not a browser trick. Your computer sees a native input device that works everywhere. \n • Clear voice — 48 kHz stereo audio over the efficient Opus codec. \n • Three latency modes — Low latency (~50 ms) for real-time use, Balanced (~100 ms) for calls, High quality for recording. \n • Private by design — audio travels only over your local network and never touches the internet. Pairing is protected by a PIN shown on your computer's screen; the wrong PIN gets no audio. \n • Auto-discovery — your iPhone finds nearby computers on the same Wi-Fi and lists them. Can't see the screen? Type the PIN instead. \n • Live level meter and mute — see your input level at a glance and mute instantly. \n • Keeps streaming in the background while you use other apps.\n\nWHAT YOU NEED \n• iPhone with iOS 16 or later \n• Mac with macOS 13 or later, Window PC and the free Microphone Link desktop app \n• Both devices on the same Wi-Fi network\n\nVisit https://miclink.eggmango.com/", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion": 0, "sellerUrl": "https://miclink.eggmango.com/", "averageUserRating": 0, "trackCensoredName": "PC Microphone: Mic for PC", "languageCodesISO2A": ["EN"], "fileSizeBytes": "1747968", "formattedPrice": "￦6,600", "contentAdvisoryRating": "4+", "trackViewUrl": "https://apps.apple.com/kr/app/pc-microphone-mic-for-pc/id6786537671?uo=4", "trackContentRating": "4+", "bundleId": "com.purplenight.miclink", "userRatingCount": 0}]}